<title>USA: Appletree Cos Chairman Kravitz to retire.</title>
<headline>Appletree Cos Chairman Kravitz to retire.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>AppleTree Cos Inc said on Monday that Chairman Paul Kravitz would retire as an officer and director of the company.</p>
<p>Allan Sorensen, a board member, will serve as chairman on a temporary basis, the company said.</p>
</text>
